      "root_cause": "The wave-fft-stage-index fix grid-strides the elementwise FFT stages (complex 2^24 now computes correctly) but the one-thread-per-element real-FFT extract kernel still dispatches a single x dimension, so outputs above 65,535 x 256 refuse by name. The prior confirmed backend defect (silently wrong values at 2^24) is fixed; what remains is an explicit capability boundary, so this is no longer a wrong-value defect but the test stays red.",
